  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A mageknight gains a small reservoir of energy she can call on to create truly wondrous effects, called a spell pool. This pool contains a number of spell points equal to her class level + her casting ability modifier (minimum 1). This pool replenishes once per day after roughly 8 hours of rest.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mageknight#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
